  Description: Prerequisite Region - Old Cheliax You grew up breeding and training
    the famous horses of the Atteran Ranches in northern Nidal. You may even be sympathetic
    to the Desnan dissidents who hide there from the Umbral Court. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Nature skill and the Animal Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Train
    Animal] skill feat.
